{
  "title": "Knobby Crisp Dutch Provolone Sandwich",
  "description": "A tangy and crisp Dutch dish featuring provolone, perfect for a lazy Sunday, and suitable for a shojin-friendly diet. The brine-wet ingredients add a unique flavor to the sandwich.",
  "cuisine": "Dutch",
